<title>USA: Borg-Warner Security names new treasurer.</title>
<headline>Borg-Warner Security names new treasurer.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Borg-Warner Security Corp appointed Brian Cooper its new treasurer.</p>
<p>Cooper will be responsible for implementation and administration of corporate financings, cash management, capital and credit controls, the company said.</p>
<p>Borg-Warner Security provides security services.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
